- ContentsDa Biology Experiment", "keywords": ["experiment", "biology", "nutrient", "science", "contentsda"], "long_description": "1. Crush Extinguishing Agent A into a membrane in a mortar and pestle.\n2. Add Extinguishing Agent A to 20 ml of distilled water and stir with a glass rod.\n3. Crush Extinguishing Agent B in a mortar and pestle.\n4. Add Extinguishing Agent B to 20 ml of distilled water and stir with a glass rod.\n5. add 3 ml of 1% starch solution to the first horizontal row of the test paper in three 9-plate grooves.\n6. add 3 ml of 1% albumin solution to the second horizontal row in three 9-groove rows.\n7. in the first row, add 3 ml of iodine-potassium iodide solution in three 9-groove rows.\n8. add 3 ml of burette solution to the second horizontal row in three 9-groove rows.\n9. in the first vertical row, add 3 ml of distilled water into the three vertical rows of 9 plates.\n10. in the second vertical row, add 3 ml of Digestant A solution to each of the 3 vertical rows of 9 plates.\n11. in the third row, add 3 ml of Extinguishing Agent B solution into each of the three 9-groove rows.\n12. Increase the temperature of the room to 38\u00b0C.\n13. Observe what happens in the 9-plate groove\n\n<Results\nA contains a large amount of protease digestive enzyme, which breaks down proteins well.\nB contains a large amount of diastase enzyme, which breaks down carbohydrates.", "short_description": "Discover the hidden nutrients in food. This experiment teaches you how to identify different nutrients present in everyday foods, a crucial aspect of understanding diet and health."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy-policy-en/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/terms-and-conditions-en/", "publisher_name": "ContentsDa", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "conte